    "chunk_text": "weron synfulle, \u00f0eah \u00f0e heo swa ne wendon, & heom w\u00e6re b\u00e6tere \u00fe\u00e6t heo wrohton alle d\u00e6g \u00d0e restand\u00e6g wes ihalgod on \u00f0es H\u00e6lendes \u00f0rowunge fram \u00f0eowtlicum weorce; ac we nu \u00f0urfon na \u00dea Iudesican warigedon wodlice \u00f0one blindan sy\u00f0\u00f0an he ih\u00e6led w\u00e6s, \u00fea he be \u00feam H\u00e6lende sp\u00e6c & Heo s\u00e6don him to andsware, Beo \u00f0u his leorningcniht, swylce he w\u00e6re awariged gif he cristene w\u00e6re. Ac \u00fe\u00e6t nis na warigung, ac witolice bl\u00e6tsung \u00fe\u00e6t mon Criste folgie mid so\u00f0\u00e6 cristendome. Heo temdon to Moysen \u00feam m\u00e6ran lareowe \u00fe\u00e6t heo his leorningcniht\u00e6s weron & his lare folgodon; & \u00fea Iudeiscan noldon now\u00fere folgian ne Moysen ne Criste mid nane so\u00f0festnesse. \u00d0e ih\u00e6lede mon cw\u00e6\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t God nele ihyran \u00fea synfulle men, ac he ne s\u00e6de na riht. For\u00fean \u00f0e he ne cu\u00f0e \u00feagyt \u00fea halga Cristes boc \u00fee s\u00e6\u00f0 hu \u00fee manfulle mid mycele onbrurdnesse We nyton, \u00feeah he mende \u00fe\u00e6t micele wundor, \u00fe\u00e6t nan synful man ne mihte swylce tacn\u00e6 wyrc\u00e6n. \u00d0e ih\u00e6lede mon cw\u00e6\u00f0 to \u00feam heardheortum Iudeiscum, Fram \u00feissere weorlde anginne ne wear\u00f0 Freolice he sp\u00e6c her, & ful andr\u00e6dlice, Hwa mihte openigan \u00fea unsceapen\u00e6 eagen & him sih\u00f0e gifen, \u00d0a yrsodan \u00fea Iudeiscan & hine utdrifon.",
